# Patches are transport, not source. Every patch uploaded through the GitHub
# web UI has landed on main as a committed file — four times so far — and
# scripts/apply-patch.sh has been quietly removing them on the next branch.
# Ignoring them stops the round trip at the source.
*.patch
*.zip
*.diff
.env*
